    "details": "<div id=\"model-response-message-contentr_52d633973a7d286c\" class=\"markdown markdown-main-panel md-content enable-luminous-fast-follows enable-updated-hr-color stronger tutor-markdown-rendering\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out; font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\" aria-busy=\"false\" aria-live=\"polite\"><strong>What if you could solve real-world digital mysteries using only public footprints?</strong>\n<p>ReConCTF &rsquo;26 is a fun, beginner-friendly Capture the Flag (CTF) competition focused primarily on Open Source Intelligence (OSINT), where you step into the shoes of a digital investigator to hunt down hidden information across the internet.</p>\n<p>You will have to trace online footprints, analyze metadata, verify imagery, uncover hidden aliases, connect scattered clues, and most importantly, capture the flags!</p>\n<p><strong>Format:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1517657694-26\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\n<div class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c1517657694-26\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ng-tns-c1517657694-26\"><code class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1517657694-26 no-decoration-radius\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">Team Size: 2&ndash;4 Participants\n</code></li>\n<li class=\"ng-tns-c1517657694-26\"><code class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1517657694-26 no-decoration-radius\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">Solve Diverse Osint Challenges\nInvestigate and Analyze Targets Using Open Source Tools\n</code></li>\n<li class=\"ng-tns-c1517657694-26\"><code class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1517657694-26 no-decoration-radius\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">Submit Your Discovered Flags to The Live Scoreboard\nChallenges </code></li>\n<li class=\"ng-tns-c1517657694-26\"><code class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1517657694-26 no-decoration-radius\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\" role=\"text\" data-test-id=\"code-content\">Span Across Geolocation, Forensics, and Web Recon\nFinal Results Are Determined by Total Points Scored\n</code></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><strong>Rules:</strong></p>\n<div class=\"formatted-code-block-internal-container ng-tns-c1517657694-27\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\n<div class=\"animated-opacity ng-tns-c1517657694-27\" style=\"font-family: Google Sans Text, sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ng-tns-c1517657694-27\"><code class=\"code-container formatted ng-tns-c1517657694-27 no-decoration-radius\" style=\"font-fa